 Lead "1" -- "0..*" Interaction
 User "0..1" -- "0..*" Interaction : createdBy
 Lead "1" -- "0..*" LeadQualification
 Lead "1" -- "0..*" LeadEnrichment
 Lead "1" -- "0..*" LeadScore
 WorkflowRun "0..1" -- "0..*" LeadQualification
 WorkflowRun "0..1" -- "0..*" LeadEnrichment
 WorkflowRun "0..1" -- "0..*" LeadScore
 FollowUpSequence "1" -- "0..*" FollowUpStep
 FollowUpSequence "1" -- "0..*" LeadFollowUpEnrollment
 Lead "1" -- "0..*" LeadFollowUpEnrollment
 FollowUpStep "0..1" -- "0..*" LeadFollowUpEnrollment : currentStep
 LeadFollowUpEnrollment "1" -- "0..*" FollowUpExecution
 FollowUpStep "1" -- "0..*" FollowUpExecution
 User "1" -- "0..*" FollowUpSequence : createdBy
 User "0..1" -- "0..*" FollowUpSequence : updatedBy
 User "0..1" -- "0..*" LeadFollowUpEnrollment : assignedBy
 Customer "1" -- "0..*" CustomerSegment
 Segment "1" -- "0..*" CustomerSegment
 User "0..1" -- "0..*" CustomerSegment : assignedBy
 User "1" -- "0..*" Segment : createdBy
 User "1" -- "0..*" Customer : createdBy
 User "0..1" -- "0..*" Customer : updatedBy
 User "0..1" -- "0..*" Customer : strategicMarkedBy
 User "0..1" -- "0..*" Segment : updatedBy
 Lead "0..1" -- "0..*" WorkflowRun
 Customer "0..1" -- "0..*" WorkflowRun
 User "0..1" -- "0..*" WorkflowRun : triggeredBy
 WorkflowRun "0..1" -- "0..*" ReviewTask
 Lead "0..1" -- "0..*" ReviewTask : canonical optional Lead association
 User "0..1" -- "0..*" ReviewTask : assignee
 User "1" -- "0..*" Notification
 Lead "0..1" -- "0..*" Notification
 Customer "0..1" -- "0..*" Notification
 ReviewTask "0..1" -- "0..*" Notification
 User "0..1" -- "0..*" AuditLog : actor

 ' Relationships between customer insight and Topic 12 domain entities.
 Customer "1" -- "0..*" CustomerIssue
 User "0..1" -- "0..*" CustomerIssue : assignedTo
 User "0..1" -- "0..*" CustomerIssue : createdBy
 Customer "1" -- "0..*" CustomerChurnAssessment
 WorkflowRun "0..1" -- "0..*" CustomerChurnAssessment
 Customer "1" -- "0..*" CustomerFeedback
 WorkflowRun "0..1" -- "0..*" CustomerFeedback
 Customer "1" -- "0..*" CustomerHealthAssessment
 WorkflowRun "0..1" -- "0..*" CustomerHealthAssessment
 Customer "1" -- "0..*" CustomerTask
 User "0..1" -- "0..*" CustomerTask : createdBy
 CustomerIssue "0..1" -- "0..*" CustomerTask : sourceIssue
 CustomerChurnAssessment "0..1" -- "0..*" CustomerTask : sourceChurnAssessment
 CustomerFeedback "0..1" -- "0..*" CustomerTask : sourceFeedback
 CustomerHealthAssessment "0..1" -- "0..*" CustomerTask : sourceHealthAssessment
 WorkflowRun "0..1" -- "0..*" CustomerTask
 User "0..1" -- "0..*" CustomerTask : assignee
 SalesMeeting "0..1" -- "0..*" ConversationTranscript
 User "0..1" -- "0..*" SalesMeeting : organizer
 User "0..1" -- "0..*" ConversationTranscript : createdBy
 Customer "0..1" -- "0..*" SalesMeeting
 Lead "0..1" -- "0..*" SalesMeeting
 Customer "0..1" -- "0..*" ConversationTranscript
 Lead "0..1" -- "0..*" ConversationTranscript
 ConversationTranscript "1" -- "0..*" ConversationSummary
 ConversationSummary "1" -- "0..*" ConversationActionItem
 Customer "0..1" -- "0..*" ConversationActionItem
 Lead "0..1" -- "0..*" ConversationActionItem
 User "0..1" -- "0..*" ConversationActionItem : assignee
 Customer "0..1" -- "0..*" Quote
 Lead "0..1" -- "0..*" Quote
 User "1" -- "0..*" Quote : createdBy
 User "0..1" -- "0..*" Quote : approvedBy
 Quote "1" -- "0..*" QuoteItem
 ProductCatalogItem "0..1" -- "0..*" QuoteItem
 Customer "1" -- "0..*" CustomerContract
 User "0..1" -- "0..*" CustomerContract : createdBy
 CustomerContract "1" -- "0..*" RenewalAttempt
 WorkflowRun "0..1" -- "0..*" RenewalAttempt

 note bottom
   This is the complete conceptual domain model for the finished AI CRM Automation product; use the ERD for exact relational columns and keys.
   WorkflowRun output may hold transient Customer 360/Next Best Action output. Queryable business histories use dedicated entities as specified in the SRS.
   CustomerTask is for operational customer work and remains distinct from ReviewTask for explicit human approval/review.
   One Customer may be referenced by multiple Leads via convertedCustomer.
   Transcript text is redacted before AI; backend owns scoring policies, quote calculations, authorization, idempotency, and persistence.
   ReviewTask may target Lead or an allowlisted polymorphic resource; enforce target validation, authorization, policy, idempotency and audit in the backend.
 end note
@enduml
